  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nSynapse already allows configuring auto join to a list of rooms after signup.\r\n\r\nIt would be neat for communities to have the possibility of adding auto-join rooms for a community. So when an invite to a community is accepted by a user, the user would automatically be joined (or invited?) to a selected list of rooms.",
